WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Really

2
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:08,350
Then can I hold her, Master?

3
00:00:08,630 --> 00:00:09,870
She doesn't have a little girl

4
00:00:10,070 --> 00:00:11,430
It's a little female mouse

5
00:00:11,910 --> 00:00:13,190
When will this girl learn?

6
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:15,530
Such words of tiger and wolf, young master

7
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:17,930
Does she have a name?

8
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:20,670
I just picked it up yesterday and haven’t had time to pick it up yet.

9
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:33,040
Why don't you give her a name? What's wrong with a name? Thank you, Master. I know what to give her.

10
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:35,880
What name should I give it, young master?

11
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:39,280
How about we call her Yuan Bao Yuan Bao

12
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:41,850
Why such a name?

13
00:00:42,370 --> 00:00:46,100
Because everyone loves Yuan Bao so much, little guy

14
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:50,240
You will call me Yuan Bao from now on, do you understand?

15
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,880
Yuan Bao understands what I say. I know.
